[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12660.19, "timestamp": "03:31:00", "text": "呃，错了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12661.79, "timestamp": "03:31:01", "text": "密码。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12664.55, "timestamp": "03:31:04", "text": "好的。而我需要获得CP来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12666.87, "timestamp": "03:31:06", "text": "继续主线任务。是的，就是为了这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12669.55, "timestamp": "03:31:09", "text": "我会告诉你你需要做什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12672.309, "timestamp": "03:31:12", "text": "嗯，把所有缺点都像这样描述一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12675.19, "timestamp": "03:31:15", "text": "像这样的子系统，并提升它们的等级。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12678.389, "timestamp": "03:31:18", "text": "此外，一路走来。啊，我为什么要这么做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12680.51, "timestamp": "03:31:20", "text": "那？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12683.349, "timestamp": "03:31:23", "text": "等等，我把邮件展示出来了。没关系。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12695.469, "timestamp": "03:31:35", "text": "美好的。乔，怎么了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12700.79, "timestamp": "03:31:40", "text": "你？我会把它删掉。或许"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12703.67, "timestamp": "03:31:43", "text": "没关系。我全泄露了。大多数人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12711.75, "timestamp": "03:31:51", "text": "小心点，乔克。是的，那是私人的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12714.35, "timestamp": "03:31:54", "text": "电子邮件。所以，我真的需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12715.71, "timestamp": "03:31:55", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12718.15, "timestamp": "03:31:58", "text": "小心。好的。所以，等等，等等。"}]